            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "In addition to my many other talents, I am a student of many forms of sea-life.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Excavator_Diver_01.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/RutherfordWest_CEL_OP_02.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 227262,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "CL-CAMP-NPC09_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "According to my studies, the ancient giant clams in Celestia can produce a rare treasure... a Ghost Pearl!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Excavator_Diver_01.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/RutherfordWest_CEL_OP_03.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 227262,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "CL-CAMP-NPC09_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "These are immeasurably valuable. Finding one would do much to offset the losses this expedition has suffered.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Excavator_Diver_01.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/RutherfordWest_CEL_OP_04.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 227262,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "CL-CAMP-NPC09_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Can you examine the giant clams scattered throughout Celestia and see if one of them has produced a Ghost Pearl?",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Excavator_Diver_01.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/RutherfordWest_CEL_OP_05.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 227262,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "CL-CAMP-NPC09_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Other than the one near the place I was rescued, I do not know where else these giant clams may be found. Keep an eye open!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Excavator_Diver_01.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/RutherfordWest_CEL_OP_06.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 227262,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
